          "indigenousText": "mo Lapil, do mo nakman am, ka mangay jino simaraw do niciyo?",
          "chineseText": "Lapil，明天是星期天，你打算去哪裡？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65742/919056.mp3",
